/*
 * Declares the BoolValue class.
 *
 * BoolValue represents a boolean literal (`true` or `false`). It is a fully
 * reduced compile-time literal and participates in constant folding and
 * semantic evaluation wherever a boolean value is required.
 *
 * Boolean literals are immutable, have no throwers, and cloning them returns
 * the same instance since they carry no internal state beyond their truth
 * value.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::literal::bool_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/literal/bool_.yr
 * @Author(s):
